      "explanation": "<p>A more stable radical means lesser the bond dissociation energy.</p>\n<p>Radicals formed are</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2021 Paper 2 Online Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 28 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1l0m5b3ic/1275df19-7d58-4270-a0cb-046176589729/9e809440-a113-11ec-86fa-b503d719c605/file-1l0m5b3id.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Radical formed from Q (PhCH<sub>2</sub><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.505ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -583 778 665\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>H) is most stable due to resonance.</p>\n<p>Stability of free radical decreases with increase in % s-character.</p>\n<p>P radical <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> sp<sup>3</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> % s-character 25%</p>\n<p>R radical <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> sp<sup>2</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> % s-character 33%</p>\n<p>S radical <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> sp <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> % s-character 50%</p>\n<p>Thus, order of stability of free radical is</p>\n<p>Q &gt; P &gt; R &gt; S</p>\n<p>Order of bond dissociation energy is</p>\n<p>S &gt; R &gt; P &gt; Q</p>"
